<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-12T20:59:02.015Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 20:59:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Axe-wielding men attacked opposition candidate Peter Obi's campaign in Lagos, while gunmen abducted five people and shot two in a Plateau community. Troops ambushed and neutralized 14 bandits in Katsina, and violence in northern Nigeria forced tens of thousands to flee into Niger. Opposition leaders NDC and Obi condemned the Lagos attack and demanded arrests, while Tinubu’s camp and Atiku accused each other of responsibility for the insecurity that has left 638 Nigerians killed in one month. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQeEZocDhmNF9JMUJJZUZJTEROelQ4bFBlR0RNX3hHR3ExeHlGYnJ3Nm1HR3lCc3FoNU0tTXJUTDM0Qi1zMTMtYU5DNEF1Q0xLZWQ3YlFNNlFlQ01naUFvbnNGZE80NXZBT01tVDh3TXFSVXc2RU4tVklaanFiTWF5a214X1c2ZExmUXBpVklRX2pxODg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPX0RHTTNBUy1ScjJ4ekxwUXpTclJDRGZKSGM4cVR0Rnl6Qmozby1YM213czh1X3VEeDIwVmN0d2x3cWxCMXV4N2NORTl1Q2NBMTlzYXd5SEp2MlFNbVpSQjV6RThSUFFvTXlFTGxqMzhvYnpselNGRzRyOU5BNTMydUZxckpqUnVyOVhF?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxPRXl0bGNGR0tzcExjQnhpOEZVektucGhMOTYxSHNTelQ5dGktTmxZeV9jaHh2dGVTUF9HN2oxMndueVFyT0R4bF9uU09GMVpRUFIyM1FaMGJfZVVxTk9OM21BZG92bHktSmk1eXBzdlNUQ2tCMWZ1Z2gybmFKRnQ2V09rbEVXd0lJaTRMUk1RUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&qu